  "description": "Han Bomi has suffered from \"first love rejection syndrome,\" dreaming about her first love every night. One day, she has an incredibly vivid dream in which her first love, Park Uyeon, has somehow become tiny. What seems too real to be a dream and too absurd to be reality becomes the chance that reconnects their broken first love through one small coincidence.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/challenge/list?titleId=852267)",
